Server init.
>> a := Blob anyar: 4.
a bytes: ( Dhaptar anyar ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob anyar: 4.
b bytes: ( Dhaptar anyar ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a anyar.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Wetonan tulis: ['xorred:'], baris-anyar. 
Wetonan tulis: n, baris-anyar. 
} cekel: { :e Wetonan tulis: e, baris-anyar. }, wiwiti.
a bebasna.
b bebasna.
